{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YgosvQJPjX1793072237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球大學校長及領袖高峰會，一連兩日在灣仔會展舉行。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超、立法會主席李慧琼等，擔任揭幕禮主禮嘉賓。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NORTH-1000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267jGsoeZUZQ1793072240.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>高峰會首日的教育論壇，以北都大學城與「政產學研投」為主題，而明天將舉行法律及青年人論壇。會議為本港大專院校搭建交流平台，多名局長及本港大學校長出席外，亦有逾50間來自20多個國家的大學校長或管理層到場分享，包括美國哈佛大學和英國劍橋大學等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:21.477458+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:31.473144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:45.289621+00:00","content_hash":"c5bb06ef71ee139ab784bd655f27f2ecda6fb3da97bfc3b30b911d8504a43de0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}